{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36312","headline":"送王侍郎浙东入朝 · 方干","name":"送王侍郎浙东入朝","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"自将苦节酬清秩，肯要庞眉一个钱。\n恩爱已苏句践国，程途却上大罗天。\n鱼池菊岛还公署，沙鹤松栽入画船。\n密奏无非经济术，从容几刻在炉烟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36312.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36312","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}